---
title: Lobster Eggs Benedict (CSO)
description: Use this universal preparation method when fixing lobster for salads or sandwiches.
course: breakfast
difficulty: medium
cook time: 60 minutes
prep time: 5 minutes
source.author: Sub-Zero Wolf, Mastering the CSO
source.url: https://www.subzero-wolf.com/
tags: CSO, steam
---

= Spinach =

Melt @butter{2%tbsp} in a #12-inch sauté pan{} over medium-high heat.

Add @shallot{1}(peeled, minced) and sauté until lightly brown. 
Add @spinach{8%cups}(stems removed) and cook until fully wilted. 
Season with @kosher salt{1/2%tsp} and @black pepper{1/4%tsp}.

Remove from heat, straining excess liquid if needed.
Set asize; spinach may be prepared a few hours in advance.
Gently warm in a suaté pan over low heat before assembling the eggs benedict.

= Hollandaise Sauce =

Whisk together @lemon juice{3%tbsp}, @granulated onion{1%tsp}, @smoked paprika{1/4%tsp},
@butter{3/4%cups}(softened), @salt{1/2%tsp}, and @water{2%tbsp}
in an oven-safe container, such as a #canning jar{}.
Loosely cover the jar with the lid, plastic wrap, or aluminum foil.

Place the jar on a wire rack in the middle of the #Convection Steam Oven{} (CSO).
Set the oven to Steam mode at 167°F and cook for ~{30%minutes}.

Remove the jar from the oven and blend the sauce with an immersion or countertop blender.
Keep the sauce warm until ready to serve.

= Poached Eggs =

Refer to the @./Convection Steam Oven/Breakfast/CSO Eggs 101{8%poached eggs} recipe for instructions on poaching eggs in a CSO.

= Lobster =

Using kitchen shears, cut the @lobster tails{3}(1 lb each) in half lengthwise.
Remove the meat from the shells.

Vacuum seal the meat in a heat-safe bag with any desired seasonings such as @butter, @garlic, and @lemon juice{}.

Place the container on a wire rack in the middle of the #Convection Steam Oven{} (CSO).
Set the oven to Steam mode at 135-140°F and cook for ~{30%minutes}.
(Note: select 135°F for a more tender texture, or 140°F for a firmer texture.)

Carefully remove the meat from the bag and cut into 8 equal portions.
Alternatively, to use for salads or sandwiches, chill in a ice bath.

= Assembly =

Place a small amount of warmed spinach on each @English Muffin{4}(halved, toasted) half.

Top each half with a portion of lobster and a poached egg.

Top eggs with 1 tablespoon of hollandaise sauce.

Sprinkle with @chives and @smoked paprika{} for garnish, if desired.
